---
title: yareli's press
layout: main
---

<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-5 gap-2">
  <div class="sm:col-span-5 flex flex-col flex-wrap">
    <div class="flex-1 w-full h-full p-2 border bc bg">
      <h2 class="w-full text-sm font-bold uppercase fg-i bg-i p-1 mb-2">yareli's press</h2>
      <img class="w-24 sm:w-1/6 float-left mr-2 mb-1 sm:mb-0 rounded-xl" src="/content/images/icon.jpeg">
      <p class="type text-sm text-justify">
        <b>hello there... it's yareli!</b> welcome to my personal blog and website. i write about video games,
        anime, manga, personal stuff, and whatever else. currently trying to hit around 2-3 new posts a month
        (as of November)! consider stopping by the <b><a class="type link" href="/pages/about">/about</a></b>
        page for more information, and/or following  my website <b><a class="type link "href="/feed.xml">via RSS</a></b>
        if you'd like to be notified of new posts and updates. **this site is mobile-friendly but is best
        experienced on desktop! please enjoy your stay, and thanks for stopping by.
        <br><br>
        <b><!--# views --></b> unique site visitors so far!
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="sm:col-span-5 md:col-span-3 flex flex-col flex-wrap">
    <div class="flex-1 w-full h-full p-2 border bc bg">
      <h2 class="w-full text-sm font-bold uppercase fg-i bg-i p-1 mb-2">featured post</h2>

      <div class="flex-1">
        {%- assign featured = collections.featuredPosts | first -%}
        <p class="type text-xs fg">{{ featured.date | date: "%b %d, %Y" }}</p>
        <h1 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold fg ">{{ featured.data.title }}</h1>
        <p class="type text-xs fg mb-4"><i>{{ featured.data.subtitle }}</i></p>

        <img eleventy:output="{{ featured.url }}" class="w-full sm:w-5/12 sm:block float-left mr-3 mb-2 sm:mb-0 ft-img" src="{{ featured.url }}cover.jpeg" />

        <div id="content" class="text-justify strip-content">
          {{ featured.content | truncatewords: 81 | replace: "<br>", " " }}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex-1 mt-4">
        <a class="link text-sm type font-black uppercase" href="{{ featured.url }}">Read Full Post &gt;&gt;</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="sm:col-span-5 md:col-span-2 flex flex-col flex-wrap">
    <div class="flex-1 w-full h-full p-2 border bc bg">
      <h2 class="w-full text-sm font-bold uppercase fg-i bg-i p-1 mb-2">recent posts</h2>

      <div class="flex-1">
        {% assign posts = collections.posts | reverse %}
        {% for post in posts limit:5 %}
          <div class="mb-2 sm:mb-4">
            <div class="text-xxs type uppercase">{{ post.date | date: "%Y-%m-%d"  }}</div>
            <a class="link fg" href="{{ post.url }}"><b>{{ post.data.title }}</b></a>
          </div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>

      <div class="flex-1 mt-6">
        <a class="link text-sm type font-black uppercase" href="/pages/archive/">See Full Archive &gt;&gt;</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="sm:col-span-5 flex flex-col flex-wrap">
    <div class="flex-1 w-full h-full p-2 border bc bg">
      <h2 class="w-full text-sm font-bold uppercase fg-i bg-i p-1 mb-2">buttons n' badges !!!</h2>

      <div class="flex flex-1 flex-wrap gap-1 mx-auto w-11/12 sm:w-2/3 md:w-1/2">
        <div class="flex-auto"><a href="https://lakespirit.love/"><img eleventy:ignore src="/content/images/88x31/lakespirit.png"></a></div>
        <div class="flex-auto"><a href="https://systemdrift.neocities.org/"><img eleventy:ignore src="/content/images/88x31/systemdrift.gif"></a></div>
        <div class="flex-auto"><a href="https://steelonbone.neocities.org/"><img eleventy:ignore src="/content/images/88x31/steelonbone.png" ></a></div>
        <div class="flex-auto"><img eleventy:ignore src="/content/images/88x31/exchanger.png" ></div>
        <div class="flex-auto"><a href="https://www.warppoint.games/"><img eleventy:ignore src="/content/images/88x31/warp-point.png"></a></div>
        <div class="flex-auto"><a href="https://nekoweb.org/"><img eleventy:ignore src="/content/images/88x31/nekoweb.gif" ></a></div>
        <div class="flex-auto"><a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/437000/GUILTY_GEAR_2_OVERTURE/"><img eleventy:ignore src="/content/images/88x31/overture.png" ></a></div>
        <div class="flex-auto"><a href="https://www.playstation.com/en-us/games/gravity-rush-2/"><img eleventy:ignore src="/content/images/88x31/tenebria.png" ></a></div>
